@zomato  I ordered meal from KT sweets sangrur through order no 6308834839 on 29 October 2024. But I ordered wrongly it on another address. So I cancelled ordered it immediately within a minute and placed same ordered via order no 6310146391 on my correct address at same time from the same restaurant. Zomato deducted my money two times. But till now I have not received my money of cancelled order. Now zomato is not refunding my payment excusing that your food was considered waste material by our company. I am surprised when I cancelled order with in seconds and  I ordered same order from the same restaurant then how can company considered my first order as a wastage food. Company only making fool of us. It is looting us.
